Package: matebook-e-dsi-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms (>= 3.0.11), ${misc:Depends}
Description: experimental i915 DSI backport for Huawei MateBook E 2023
 Experimental replacement i915 driver sources with DSI patches for
 Huawei MateBook E 2023 dual-link OLED under Debian Linux 6.12.107.
 .
 Hardware operation has not yet been validated. Sleep, DPMS and built-in
 panel operation require on-device testing.
